1
00:00:00,704 --> 00:00:04,834
...we set aside a day to celebrate
all your contributions to my life...

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,130
(Sheldon:)...both actual and imagined by you.

3
00:00:09,546 --> 00:00:11,426
(Sheldon:)We could call it Leonard's Day.

4
00:00:13,133 --> 00:00:15,213
I kind of Iike the sound of that.

5
00:00:15,385 --> 00:00:18,425
(Sheldon:)Of course you do.
It's about you, like everything else.

6
00:00:18,805 --> 00:00:23,855
(Sheldon:)Oh, thank goodness. I don't think I had it
in me to make another glass of water.

7
00:00:24,019 --> 00:00:26,859
(Leonard:)So do I get breakfast in bed
on Leonard's Day?

8
00:00:27,022 --> 00:00:28,982
(Leonard:)- No.
- Can I sit in your spot?

9
00:00:29,149 --> 00:00:31,859
(Leonard:)- No.
- Could I control the thermostat?

10
00:00:32,027 --> 00:00:34,067
(Leonard:)- No.
- Do I get a card?

11
00:00:34,237 --> 00:00:35,907
(Sheldon:)Of course you get a card.

12
00:00:36,782 --> 00:00:38,532
(Sheldon:)It's Leonard's Day.

13
00:00:39,451 --> 00:00:42,791
(Penny:)Hey, guys. The building manager said
the reason the power went out...

14
00:00:42,954 --> 00:00:46,874
...is someone went into the basement
and pulled the main breaker switch.

15
00:00:49,795 --> 00:00:51,175
(Sheldon:)Really.

16
00:00:52,589 --> 00:00:54,379
(Leonard:)Who do you think did that, Sheldon?

17
00:00:54,674 --> 00:00:59,024
(Sheldon:)Oh, I don't know.

